'''Spice freighters''' were [[starship]]s that carried the drug [[spice]]. The ''[[Twilight]]'' was such a vessel.<ref name="Twilight">{{Databank|twilight|''Twilight''}}</ref>

During the [[Imperial Era]], the [[moisture farmer]] [[Owen Lars]] told his nephew [[Luke Skywalker]] that his [[Anakin Skywalker|father]] had been a [[navigator]] on a such a [[freighter]].<ref name="IV">{{Film|IV}}</ref>

